essed many issues from the playtest, but I'm still working through some of the bigger feature requests. Stay tuned fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T21:10:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702982","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3978490-1826362059925869","game_id":"steam-3978490","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is Live!","summary":"The playtest has been launched! It will stay up until March 13 at 11:59PM PT. I will be working on improving the build throughout the week and will update this thread with any changes. If you have any feedback, feel free to comment here or in this Google Form. There's a ton of rough edges currently, so I appreciate your patience while working through those. My goal is to address as much feedback as possible from this playtest before adding more features.The songs are ordered roughly in order of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T00:19:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059925869","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3978490-1825727806706169","game_id":"steam-3978490","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Details and New Backgrounds","summary":"Playtest DetailsThere is now an option to join the playtest on the Steam page - so press that and you'll be notified when it launches!I'm pushing back the targeted start date to March 6th (apologies for the delay!), and it will last for a week. There's a few more features I want to add / waiting for approval from Steam on the initial build.Here's what to expect from the playtest:7 different songs of varying levelsroguelike learning systemupgrade systemprogressive difficulty system The game is st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-25T23:12:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806706169","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3978490-1823191198607487","game_id":"steam-3978490","kind":"announcement","title":"Upcoming Playtest, Typing Mode, and Split Staff","summary":"Upcoming PlaytestI'm targeting a Steam technical playtest at the end of February. This will show a vertical slice of the game - stay tuned for more details in the next update.Comment below If there's any songs in the public domain that you want to see in the technical playtest, I'll do my best to get them in! Typing ModeIf you don't have a MIDI keyboard or you just want to play a typing game, I've got good news!I've added a new setting that adds letters to the notes / piano keys to make it easie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-31T14:20:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198607487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3978490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3978490":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3978490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4694730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3978490","app_id":3978490,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:26Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStore